<title>UK: John D Wood receives possible bid approach.</title>
<headline>John D Wood receives possible bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>John D. Wood &amp; Co Ltd, an estate agency and property letting group, said on Tuesday it had received an approach that might lead to an offer for the company.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>By 1600 GMT, its shares had risen 6p to stand at 120-1/2p.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
